    card title "Who? What? When?"

A: How do you ask who, what or when in Russian, and how does a plain sentence become a question?
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name

B: I'm showing Tom a photo from home. Listen to his questions.
    draw ph_frame p_bro p_cat

    highlight p_bro color #c9871a effect pulse

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: Кто э́то? Who is this? Кто, new today, means who, and э́то is this, from lesson eight.
    highlight talk_1_words part кто color #c9871a

B: My answer drops кто and gives the news instead: э́то мой брат.
    highlight talk_2_words part "мой брат" color #c9871a

    erase talk

    highlight p_cat color #c9871a effect pulse

    draw talkb

    draw talkb

A: Then I asked что э́то, what is this? Что is what, as in что вы хоти́те; it's written with ч, but said што.
    highlight talkb_1_words part что color #c9871a

B: And I put him right: не что, а кто! In Russian a cat is a кто, because кто is for people and animals, and что for things.
    highlight talkb_2_words part кто color #c9871a

    erase talkb photo

    hide speakers

A: So here are the question words. Кто, who: Кто э́то? Э́то Ма́ша.
    draw q_kto e_kto x_kto

B: Что, what: Что э́то? Э́то кни́га.
    draw q_chto e_chto x_chto

A: Где, where, from lesson nine: Где кот? Там.
    draw q_gde e_gde x_gde

B: Как, how, the как of как дела́: Как дела́? Хорошо́.
    draw q_kak e_kak x_kak

A: And когда́, when: Когда́? За́втра, from the days lesson.
    draw q_kogda e_kogda x_kogda

B: The question word comes first; the answer drops it and gives the news.
    highlight q_kto q_chto q_gde q_kak q_kogda color #c9871a effect pulse

    hide board

B: Some questions have no question word at all. First, a statement: Э́то кот.
    draw s_stat ar_down

B: And now a question: Э́то кот?
    draw s_q ar_up

A: Same words, same order. Only the voice changes: it rises on кот, the word in doubt, and on paper there's a question mark.
    highlight s_q part кот color #c9871a

B: And the answer is simply да or нет: да, э́то кот.
    draw i_cat s_ans

    erase tone

    show speakers

A: That's how I asked кот? at the photo, with my voice going up.
    draw ph_frame p_bro p_cat kot_q ar_kot

A: Now Masha and I make a plan; count the questions.
    erase kot_q ar_kot photo

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

B: Three questions: ко́фе, with my voice going up; когда́, when; and где, where.
    highlight talk2_1_words talk2_2_words color #c9871a effect pulse

    erase talk2

    hide speakers

    draw match

    ask "Match each question word to its meaning." on match store m reveal_style morph stage own test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Кто who, что what, где where, когда́ when.
        wrong: You got {m} on the first try.

    erase match

    draw q_cat

    pause 1

    quiz "Masha points at her cat. What does Tom ask?" store q2 reveal.text "Кто э́то? Э́то кот." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 340 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: A cat is alive, so it's кто.
        wrong: Is a cat alive, or a thing?
        + Кто э́то?
        * Что э́то?
        * Где э́то?

    erase q_cat q2_stamp

    draw q_book

    pause 1

    ask "You point at a book and ask what it is: … э́то? Type the question word." answer ["что","што","shto"] store a3 default что reveal.text "Что э́то? Э́то кни́га." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 340 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Что: a book is a thing. Written with ч, said што.
        wrong: A book is a thing, not a person: the word for what.

    erase q_book a3_stamp

    draw q_kniga ar_q4

    pause 1

    quiz "Masha says Э́то кни́га? and her voice rises on кни́га. Is she asking or telling?" store q4 reveal.text "Да, э́то кни́га." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Asking: the rising voice and the question mark make it a question.
        wrong: Listen to the voice: it goes up on кни́га.
        + Asking
        * Telling

    erase q_kniga ar_q4 q4_stamp

    draw q_cal

    pause 1

    ask "Tom asks a one-word question, and Masha answers За́втра! Type Tom's question." answer ["когда"] store a5 default когда reveal.text "Когда́? За́втра!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 340 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Когда́: when? Tomorrow!
        wrong: За́втра is a time: the word for when.

    erase q_cal a5_stamp

    show board

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    hide board

    draw r1

A: So put кто, что, где, как or когда́ first, and the answer gives what it asks for.
    highlight r1 part ^Кто color #c9871a

B: No question word? Then let your voice rise on the word you're asking about.
    draw r2 ar_r2

    erase r1 r2 ar_r2

    show board

A: Five small words and one rising voice, and you can ask about almost anything.
    highlight q_kto q_chto q_gde q_kak q_kogda color #c9871a effect pulse

    hide board

A: Just remember: the cat is a кто. Пока́!
    icon end_cat size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat
    text end_kto "кто" #1f6f78 say кто x 500 y 360 font_size 110

